### Xcode ###

## Xcode 8 and earlier

### Xcode Patch ###
*.xcodeproj/*
!*.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
!*.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/
!*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/

# The top-level .xcworkspace is a personal co-development workspace: it exists only to shadow the
# Photo Club Hub Data dependency with a local checkout, so it is private and untracked. The tracked
# Package.resolved — the record of which library version a release was built against — lives in
# *.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/ above, and there is deliberately only one of them. See #808.
# Anchored with a leading slash so it cannot match *.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/.
/*.xcworkspace/
/*.gcno
**/xcshareddata/WorkspaceSettings.xcsettings

# End of https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/macos,swift,xcode

